From {{etyl|la}} {{term|stridens|strīdēns|lang=la}}, present active participle of {{term|strido|strīdō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|/ˈstɹaɪ.dənt/}}
* {{audio|en-us-strident.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{context|literally}} [[loud|Loud]]; [[shrill]], [[piercing]], high-[[pitch]]ed; [[rough]]-sounding.
#: ''The trumpet sounded '''strident''' against the string orchestra.''
# {{context|figuratively}} Loud, shrill.

